For an international institution, we are urgently looking for a Full Remote - Senior Technical Writer. As Technical Writer, you will be responsible for technical documentation of a variety of solutions and projects, through their lifecycle. This includes documentation for new systems as well as the creation and update of documentation for legacy systems. We require an experienced and highly motivated technical writer with a strong desire to make an impact.

Candidates need to be fluent in English. All positions are long-term. This position is open for freelancers and employees.

Candidates need to be able to work some New York hours. (Example 9 AM NY time equals 7:30 PM).

Tasks and Responsibilities:

• Work with product managers, technical leads, and developers to produce and maintain world-class documentation, including system design, architecture diagrams, requirement documents, user guides, integration guides, API developer guides, system embedded documentation (tooltips, welcome instructions, and tutorials);

• Work closely with the team in NY to obtain precise information on the developed/deployed systems, tools, and APIs;

• Using direct access to the source code, verify the validity of technical documentation;

• Be responsible for writing, updating, and proof-reading existing technical documentation, compiling all technical documentation through professional and standard layouts;

